<string name="consent_share">Share only supported USB/OMAPI SIM authentication with this gateway? No raw APDU tunnel, PIN attempts, profile deletion or downloads are enabled by this preview.</string>
<string name="call_confirm">Place a carrier call using this exact SIM and route? This may incur charges. Network loss never automatically redials.</string>
<string name="sms_confirm">Send this message once? This may incur charges. An uncertain result must be checked in history before sending again.</string>
<string name="help_text">Use Android 9+ and an OTG USB CCID reader supporting APDU-level exchange. An active SIM profile must already exist; locked cards are not unlocked automatically. OMAPI depends on the device and SIM access rules. A reader is not a radio: its calls/SMS use the server VoWiFi provider. Phone-installed SIM calls use the system dialer.

Stay available uses a visible foreground notification and network-change callbacks. No idle wake lock, restart watchdog, exact alarms or paid-operation retry. Android Doze/OEM restrictions can still delay incoming calls; test screen-off delivery on your phone. Reader mode needs the existing Core 10-second health interval. Pause stops sharing and notifications. No host cellular forwarding is implemented.</string>
